        <activityName xml:lang="en">Construction work, coolant circuit</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Construction work, coolant circuit
This data set describes the construction work for the excavation of the conduits for the refrigerant circuit and the construction works in house (excavation, concrete use). Data stems from questionnaire and are partly estimated.;
UUID: ccfba51b-8b0c-39d1-93f6-a33e4c18088a
This data set includes excavation requirements for the conduits and building requirements in the house.
Location: This data represent the construction work in Switzerland.
Technology: The coolant circuit is
Time period: Actual data.
Production volume: na
Sampling: questionnaire 
Extrapolations: no extrapolations
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ccfba51b-8b0c-39d1-93f6-a33e4c18088a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
